MIFM1's changes to fm1-base (base/) and its felucca-bsp (base/bsp/), applied by tools/patch_base.sh before a build.
The USB audio input with more than two channels (FELUCCA_UAC_CH, FM1B_UAC_CH): MIFM1 records its four tracks and
its effects' return over USB, 10 channels (tools/uac_multi_test.c).

